# Placeholder so `//go:embed all:ui/dist` always matches, even in a source
# checkout where the SPA has not been built. The real files (produced by the
# Containerfile's node stage: `npm run build`) are NOT committed; when present
# they are embedded instead of this placeholder.
#
# Without this file `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` fail with
#   "pattern all:ui/dist: no matching files found"
# before the Docker build ever runs.
